from filename "../../module/re_entry_cycle.pya" ob name re-entry cycle to name re-entry cycle be import do
exists su name author prompt ob text "Draft: be concise and friendly." be text ya
exists su name critic prompt ob text "Critique: list issues + propose fixes." be text ya
exists su name author be mind as name "qwen3-vl:8b-instruct" accordingto name author prompt ya
exists su name critic be mind as name "qwen3-vl:8b-instruct" accordingto name critic prompt ya
exists su name task ob text "Write a short greeting." be text ya
to name text result fromindex num 0 toindex num 2 be re-entry cycle do
ob name result be write do
